  "name": "Ranger: Falconstrike ranks retain the authored 121 percent ranged weapon damage (#5932, #5933)",
  "contract": [
    "The preserved CoA build-hub skill and talent tooltips both specify 121% ranged weapon damage for Falconstrike.",
    "The level-11 root 806345 has effect 2 WEAPON_PERCENT_DAMAGE with BasePoints 120 and DieSides 1.",
    "Higher ranks keep the same transformation and only increase the additive Nature amount; their shipped percentages",
    "are malformed: rank 2 is 929% and rank 8 is 3197%. Normal Horn casts must prepare Falconstrike at the reported",
    "levels 18 and 60, and normal casts must deal damage within the 121% weapon bounds and consume readiness.",
    "Bow 3036 has 16.875-28.125 damage and a 2500ms swing; normalized ranged swings use 2800ms. Matching-level enemies",
    "have zero Nature resistance. The observed native minimum weapon damage supplies a lower bound; the damage",
    "ceilings allow bow spread, normalization, additive 15/78 damage and a doubled critical hit, excluding 929/3197%."
  ],
